<title>ITALY: Naples air cargo down 4pct in Q1.</title>
<headline>Naples air cargo down 4pct in Q1.</headline>
<text>
<p>ROME, April 24 (REUTER) - Air cargo handled at Naples airport fell by four percent in the first quarter compared to the same 1996 period, the airport authority said.</p>
<p>Air traffic details are shown below</p>
<p>		Mar 97    Pct change    Jan-Mar '97    Pct change</p>
<p>	    (tonnes)   from Mar 96    (tonnes)   from Jan-Mar '96</p>
<p>Cargo Imports</p>
<p>Flown	 109.1     down 17.8	 312.6	  down 16.2</p>
<p>Trucked	   0		 0	 512.8	  down 13.6</p>
<p>Total	 109.1     down 17.8	 625.4	  down 14.8</p>
<p>Cargo Exports</p>
<p>Flown	 187.2	  up 8.5	  472.8	 down 12.7</p>
<p>Trucked     229.7	  up 8.3	    0		   0</p>
<p>Total	 416.9	  up 7.5	  472.8	 down 12.7</p>
<p>All Cargo</p>
<p>Flown	 296.3	down 4.0	 788.2	  down 14.0</p>
<p>Trucked     229.7	  up 8.3	 512.8	  down 13.6</p>
<p>Total	 526.0	  up 1.0     1,298.9	  down 13.9</p>
<p>Total Mail  187.8	 up 33.6	 524.9	    up 46.1</p>
<p>Total Pax  12,670	 up 51.4	33,039	    up 40.1</p>
<p>--Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706;  Fax:</p>
